<details>
<summary>⚠️ 生成的C++代码 (错误位置)</summary>

```cpp
  15   ObjectPtr<Future<String>> riskyOperation(Bool shouldFail);
  16   ObjectPtr<Future<String>> slowOperation();
  17   ObjectPtr<Future<Nullable>> cascadingAsyncError();
  18   ObjectPtr<Stream<String>> generateMessages();
  19   ObjectPtr<Stream<Int>> generateNumbers(Int count);
